                        ],
                        "form": "ота́ве"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a00ddd47-4b56-4ceb-9d92-3d1afc269349",
                        "entry_id": "afa77201-3e0c-36d3-9a92-ab0436f900f8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ота́вах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b3a8c920-984d-3bfc-9f03-40d2b3dd5d08",
                        "entry_id": "afa77201-3e0c-36d3-9a92-ab0436f900f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "с.-х. трава, выросшая на месте скошенной в том же году"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e3c2101-c22c-42a5-a9e2-5ce5c21b54c4",
                                "sense_id": "b3a8c920-984d-3bfc-9f03-40d2b3dd5d08",
                                "text": "То в луг иду смотреть траву, … Велю в саду ее косить, … Сбираю добрую отаву // С поречных я моих лужков."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ba74c02-7536-4228-9b2f-23e7f63f6d32",
                                "sense_id": "b3a8c920-984d-3bfc-9f03-40d2b3dd5d08",
                                "text": "А всё везде было тихо и отрадно, ровная отава в лугах как расчёсанная, застыли, не шевельнутся на бровках сухие былиночки."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72a45b16-4fad-4e66-a5f7-07f6f1b786a8",
                                "sense_id": "b3a8c920-984d-3bfc-9f03-40d2b3dd5d08",
                                "text": "Золотится поздняя отава // Шёлковой ребячьей головой."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9269ead-d7a0-4fab-9aa5-be531eef1063",
                                "sense_id": "b3a8c920-984d-3bfc-9f03-40d2b3dd5d08",
                                "text": "А дальше, где кончается отава подкошенная, народу тьма!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9607d53b-db84-4b71-8a5f-2d0fc444a376",
                        "source_entry_id": "afa77201-3e0c-36d3-9a92-ab0436f900f8",
                        "source_sense_id": "b3a8c920-984d-3bfc-9f03-40d2b3dd5d08",
                        "target_lang_word": "aftermath",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aftermath",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14dc0021-019d-368f-9f18-b67b979ea994",
                                        "entry_id": "49d0bb4d-8cf7-3bbf-a4f0-5ba6febefdb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A second mowing; the grass which grows after the first crop of hay in the same season; lattermath."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1611fef-7f3c-47bb-bf7e-8ef4851825c9",
                                                "sense_id": "14dc0021-019d-368f-9f18-b67b979ea994",
                                                "text": "They were cutting aftermath on all sides, which gave the neighbourhood, this gusty autumn morning, an untimely smell of hay."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14e3bc67-8156-3831-9585-4731b1600622",
                                        "entry_id": "49d0bb4d-8cf7-3bbf-a4f0-5ba6febefdb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which happens after, that which follows, usually of strongly negative connotation in most contexts, implying a preceding catastrophe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a67eaaa8-55d2-4cea-81c5-4ad0cd79c01f",
                                                "sense_id": "14e3bc67-8156-3831-9585-4731b1600622",
                                                "text": "In contrast to most projections of the aftermath of nuclear war, in this there is no rioting or looting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf01cdef-21b6-46a3-b388-ecccaaafa9ad",
